NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for businesses in Llanelli and across South and West Wales. Every logo is designed from scratch — no AI tools, no off-the-shelf templates.

## Making your Llanelli business look the part

A professional logo is the cornerstone of your brand. It shows up everywhere — your website, your signage, your van, your social media — and it's often the first thing a potential customer notices. A strong, well-designed logo builds trust instantly; a weak one raises doubts before you've had a chance to make your case.

We work with tradespeople, service businesses, hospitality companies, and retailers across Llanelli, giving them a visual identity that reflects the quality of what they do.

## What's included

- 5 initial logo concepts
- Revisions until you're completely happy
- Brand colour palette and typography
- Brand guidelines document
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG — ready for web, print, and signage

Full details on our [logo design service](/services/logo-design/).

## No AI. Designed by hand.

Every logo is drawn in Adobe Illustrator — no AI-generated artwork. Your logo is original and unique to your Llanelli business.

